Note that Example 2 demonstrates conditionals, While loops, and Repeat loops computing Fibonacci numbers.

Display text of Eathon Control Flow and Fibonacci Sequence end text.

Let n be integer 10.
Let a be integer 0.
Let b be integer 1.
Let step be integer 0.

While step is less than n repeat,
  Display a.
  Let next be a plus b.
  Set a to b.
  Set b to next.
  Set step to step plus 1.
End while.

If a is greater than 30 then,
  Display text of Final Fibonacci value exceeds threshold 30 end text.
  Display a.
Otherwise,
  Display text of Below threshold end text.
End if.

Let countdown be integer 3.
Repeat 3 times,
  Display countdown.
  Set countdown to countdown minus 1.
End repeat.
